  "main": "\n\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"MedicalBusiness\",\"name\":\"The Schoeman Clinic\",\"url\":\"/testimonials/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"96 Harley Street\",\"addressLocality\":\"London\",\"postalCode\":\"W1G 7HY\",\"addressCountry\":\"GB\"},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"reviewCount\":8,\"bestRating\":\"5\"},\"review\":[{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Douglas Jackson\"},\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"},\"reviewBody\":\"I was recommended to see Gina by a friend and have been seeing her for about a year now, and she has helped my overall health improve enormously. It’s very rare to find a Doctor that spends so much time analyzing bloodwork and figuring out exactly what was needed to balance my metabolism and maximize my overall health. Gina has intimate knowledge of both dermatology and as a GP which is very helpful especially with her understanding of hormones. Gina has a soft and kind disposition and it’s a pleasure to see her. The best and most thoughtful health care expert I have ever worked with. I can highly recommend Gina to anyone that needs help with their overall health and wellness. She will help you more than you will ever realize.\"},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Connie S\"},\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"},\"reviewBody\":\"I highly recommend Dr Gina, she has been incredibly helpful in managing my PMOS symptoms and finding the root cause. She is incredibly kind and attentive and really cares about her patients’ health and wellbeing.\"},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Sam Wright\"},\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"},\"reviewBody\":\"I have been a regular client of Dr Gina Schoeman for a few years now. Thanks to her, my perimenopause symptoms that were impacting my day to day, at a difficult time in my life, have greatly improved. I trust her implicitly and only feel comfortable with her, knowing that she knows me and has the best interest of my wellbeing. She is outstandingly professional and knowledgeable in her field. I would highly, strongly recommend her. Thank you, Dr Gina Schoeman.\"},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Thuvesa Kevin Padayachi\"},\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"},\"reviewBody\":\"I have always struggled with strength and agility irrespective of how hard I trained. I have also suffered with IBS for all my life. Since seeing Dr Gina, I understand the cause of the issues and the issues are largely resolved. I recommend Dr Gina to my friends, family and clients.\"},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Julia Reid\"},\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"},\"reviewBody\":\"Dr Gina has been wonderful with her consultations and the results of her treatment have meant I’m now living a better, healthier life. She has explained everything in a clear and easy to understand way, leaving me feeling confident and cared for. A big thank you.\"},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Yvonne Wakefield\"},\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"},\"reviewBody\":\"I have received excellent, highly personalised care at The Schoeman Clinic. I leave each appointment feeling heard and understood, knowing that my health is being so carefully monitored and supported by an experienced doctor with a progressive approach.\"},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Shelly Nel\"},\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"},\"reviewBody\":\"I highly recommend Dr Gina Schoeman. She is kind, thorough, and incredibly thoughtful in her approach. Through detailed questioning and blood tests, she built a much deeper and more complete picture of my health, which led to a personalised treatment plan that addressed both my hormonal issues and other concerns identified in my results. Adjusting my HRT made a huge difference. I now feel much more like myself and able to move forward with confidence. She is also very approachable and available for queries, which I really appreciate.\"},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Emily West\"},\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"},\"reviewBody\":\"I honestly cannot recommend Dr Gina enough. She has been absolutely incredible in helping me manage my inflammatory autoimmune condition, and without her care, I truly wouldn’t be as well as I am today. From the very beginning, she has been caring, empathetic, and exceptionally professional. She takes the time to really listen and always makes sure I fully understand what’s going on with my health. Her depth of knowledge is outstanding, and what sets her apart is how willing she is to share that knowledge. Everything she recommends is clearly explained and thoughtfully backed up. Having Dr Gina has genuinely been life-changing. She has helped me feel informed and supported, rather than overwhelmed or dismissed. You never feel like just another patient. You feel genuinely cared for. I would wholeheartedly recommend Dr Gina to anyone looking to improve their long-term or hormonal health.\"}]}</script>\n\t\t<main class=\"tsc-testimonials\">\n\t\t<section class=\"tsc-testimonials__hero\">\n\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t<p class=\"tsc-testimonials__eyebrow\">Patient Experiences</p>\n\t\t<h1>Trusted by our patients,<br>loved by our community</h1>\n\t\t<p class=\"tsc-testimonials__intro\">Discover the stories of change, balance, and renewed confidence from The Schoeman Clinic: unhurried, root-cause medicine in London and online across the UK.</p>\n\t\t<div class=\"tsc-testimonials__rating\" aria-label=\"Five out of five stars from eight verified Google reviews\">\n\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span>\n\t\t\t<small>5.0 average · 8 verified Google reviews</small>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-testimonials__film\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 120ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 120ms\">\n\t<div class=\"tsc-testimonials__poster group\">\n\t\t<img class=\"tsc-kenburns\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/testimonials-pia-poster.webp\" alt=\"Abstract editorial still life for Pia’s patient story\" width=\"1600\" height=\"912\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tsc-testimonials__poster-veil\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t<button class=\"tsc-play\" type=\"button\" data-video-src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pia-success-story.webm\" data-video-type=\"video/webm\" data-video-poster=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/testimonials-pia-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"Play Pia’s success story\"><span class=\"tsc-play__halo\"></span><span class=\"tsc-play__arc\"></span><span class=\"tsc-play__btn\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\" /></svg></span></button>\n\t\t<span class=\"tsc-play-label\">Watch Pia’s Story</span>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"tsc-testimonials__film-caption\">\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<h2>Pia’s success story</h2>\n\t\t\t<p>Patient film · 4 minutes</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-video-src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pia-success-story.webm\" data-video-type=\"video/webm\" data-video-poster=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/testimonials-pia-poster.webp\">Watch her story</button>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-testimonials__reviews\" data-testimonials=\"\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t<div class=\"tsc-testimonials__stage\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"tsc-testimonial\" data-testimonial=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tsc-testimonial__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span>\n\t\t\t\t<blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>I was recommended to see Gina by a friend and have been seeing her for about a year now, and she has helped my overall health improve enormously. It’s very rare to find a Doctor that spends so much time analyzing bloodwork and figuring out exactly what was needed to balance my metabolism and maximize my overall health. Gina has intimate knowledge of both dermatology and as a GP which is very helpful especially with her understanding of hormones. Gina has a soft and kind disposition and it’s a pleasure to see her. The best and most thoughtful health care expert I have ever worked with. I can highly recommend Gina to anyone that needs help with their overall health and wellness. She will help you more than you will ever realize.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-review-toggle=\"\" data-more=\"Read more\" data-less=\"Read less\">Read more</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Douglas Jackson</strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<small><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span> Verified Google review</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"tsc-testimonial\" data-testimonial=\"\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tsc-testimonial__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span>\n\t\t\t\t<blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>I highly recommend Dr Gina, she has been incredibly helpful in managing my PMOS symptoms and finding the root cause. She is incredibly kind and attentive and really cares about her patients’ health and wellbeing.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Connie S</strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<small><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span> Verified Google review</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"tsc-testimonial\" data-testimonial=\"\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tsc-testimonial__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span>\n\t\t\t\t<blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>I have been a regular client of Dr Gina Schoeman for a few years now. Thanks to her, my perimenopause symptoms that were impacting my day to day, at a difficult time in my life, have greatly improved. I trust her implicitly and only feel comfortable with her, knowing that she knows me and has the best interest of my wellbeing. She is outstandingly professional and knowledgeable in her field. I would highly, strongly recommend her. Thank you, Dr Gina Schoeman.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-review-toggle=\"\" data-more=\"Read more\" data-less=\"Read less\">Read more</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Sam Wright</strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<small><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span> Verified Google review</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"tsc-testimonial\" data-testimonial=\"\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tsc-testimonial__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span>\n\t\t\t\t<blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>I have always struggled with strength and agility irrespective of how hard I trained. I have also suffered with IBS for all my life. Since seeing Dr Gina, I understand the cause of the issues and the issues are largely resolved. I recommend Dr Gina to my friends, family and clients.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Thuvesa Kevin Padayachi</strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<small><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span> Verified Google review</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"tsc-testimonial\" data-testimonial=\"\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tsc-testimonial__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span>\n\t\t\t\t<blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Dr Gina has been wonderful with her consultations and the results of her treatment have meant I’m now living a better, healthier life. She has explained everything in a clear and easy to understand way, leaving me feeling confident and cared for. A big thank you.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Julia Reid</strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<small><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span> Verified Google review</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"tsc-testimonial\" data-testimonial=\"\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tsc-testimonial__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span>\n\t\t\t\t<blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>I have received excellent, highly personalised care at The Schoeman Clinic. I leave each appointment feeling heard and understood, knowing that my health is being so carefully monitored and supported by an experienced doctor with a progressive approach.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Yvonne Wakefield</strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<small><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span> Verified Google review</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"tsc-testimonial\" data-testimonial=\"\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tsc-testimonial__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span>\n\t\t\t\t<blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>I highly recommend Dr Gina Schoeman. She is kind, thorough, and incredibly thoughtful in her approach. Through detailed questioning and blood tests, she built a much deeper and more complete picture of my health, which led to a personalised treatment plan that addressed both my hormonal issues and other concerns identified in my results. Adjusting my HRT made a huge difference. I now feel much more like myself and able to move forward with confidence. She is also very approachable and available for queries, which I really appreciate.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-review-toggle=\"\" data-more=\"Read more\" data-less=\"Read less\">Read more</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Shelly Nel</strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<small><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span> Verified Google review</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"tsc-testimonial\" data-testimonial=\"\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tsc-testimonial__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span>\n\t\t\t\t<blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>I honestly cannot recommend Dr Gina enough. She has been absolutely incredible in helping me manage my inflammatory autoimmune condition, and without her care, I truly wouldn’t be as well as I am today. From the very beginning, she has been caring, empathetic, and exceptionally professional. She takes the time to really listen and always makes sure I fully understand what’s going on with my health. Her depth of knowledge is outstanding, and what sets her apart is how willing she is to share that knowledge. Everything she recommends is clearly explained and thoughtfully backed up. Having Dr Gina has genuinely been life-changing. She has helped me feel informed and supported, rather than overwhelmed or dismissed. You never feel like just another patient. You feel genuinely cared for. I would wholeheartedly recommend Dr Gina to anyone looking to improve their long-term or hormonal health.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-review-toggle=\"\" data-more=\"Read more\" data-less=\"Read less\">Read more</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Emily West</strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<small><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span> Verified Google review</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</figcaption>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"tsc-testimonials__controls\">\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-testimonial-prev=\"\" aria-label=\"Previous testimonial\">←</button>\n\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-testimonial-next=\"\" aria-label=\"Next testimonial\">→</button>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<p><strong data-testimonial-current=\"\">01</strong><span></span><em>08</em></p>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"tsc-testimonials__progress\"><span data-testimonial-progress=\"\" style=\"width:12.5%\"></span></div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-testimonials__cta\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t<p>Every story begins with one unhurried consultation. Harley Street, Wimbledon or online across the UK.</p>\n\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"btn-luxe\" href=\"/book/\">Book a consultation</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"btn-ghost-luxe\" href=\"/contact/\">Speak to the team</a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</section>\n\t</main>\n\t\t"
}
